Error [E0026]: Jet doesn't use `throw`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_throw.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     throw;
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: a function that can fail returns `T ? E` and signals failure with `err(...)`
 Fix: return `err(...)` instead of `throw`

Error [E0003]: expected a value, found `;`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_throw.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     throw;
    |          ^
 Why: a value can be a name, a number, quoted text, `true`/`false`, or a call
 Fix: e.g. `x`, `42`, `3.5`, or `"hello"`
